Subject: [PATCH 16/20] PCI/sysfs: Remove pci_{create,remove}_sysfs_dev_files()
Date: Fri, 10 Apr 2026 05:50:36 +0000
Message-ID: <20260410055040.39233-17-kwilczynski@kernel.org>
